{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"argv": ["git", "commit", "-q", "-m", "E024: prior art is the plurality of kill reasons, and the population is 20 rows rather than twelve\n\nT-0068. 'Twelve candidates, twelve prior-art deaths' is load-bearing in\nSTATE.md, HYPOTHESES.md and STATE-next-actions.md and is the stated premise of\nfour experiments and of the top open item. Neither its count nor its cause had a\ngate.\n\nH1 survives at 10 of 18 = 0.556, by exactly one row: every prior-art row, moved\nto any other category, puts the share at 0.500 and kills it, and six rows are\ncontested by the declared precedence. H2 is false -- the population is 20, and\nthe record's twelve reconciles with neither the inventory's sixteen nor any\nprimary source.\n\nSeven of eighteen died of something else: four mechanisms that failed or were\nsupported and killed by their own tests (F001, F006, F008, F012), three claims no\navailable observation could establish, and one promoted then parked with no\nreason recorded. The implicit model that every candidate died because the world\nalready had it is wrong for those rows, and F006 -- a mechanism that worked\nunder a count budget and lost under a walking-distance budget the report never\npriced -- points at a repair available at report time.\n\nThe declared control failed as constructed on a category-vocabulary mismatch, and\nits first repair scored 19/19, so it was discarded rather than reported as a pass.\nThe replacement, E016's independent verdicts, scores 12 of 12 against a baseline\nof 9, with the disclosure that the three known gaps were read before use.\n\nThe rule's own gate was falsified against its own bytes in both directions and\ncaught four errors in the author's hand work, including two restated deciding\nsentences that do not exist in their cited sources."], "cwd": "/home/ubuntu/think-free", "duration_ms": 20, "exit_code": 0, "log": "sessions/2026-10-05-010-test-whether-twelve-candidates-twelve-pr/commands.log", "log_line_end": 16, "log_line_start": 9, "redactions": [], "summary": "$ git commit -q -m E024: prior art is the plurality of kill reasons, and the population is 20 rows rather than twelve\n\nT-0068. 'Twelve candida"}, "duration_ms": 20, "exit_code": 0, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "command", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 9, "session": "2026-10-05-010-test-whether-twelve-candidates-twelve-pr", "ts": "2026-10-05T13:20:27+00:00"}
